\includegraphics[width=0.85\linewidth]{fig5_lambda_curve}
\caption{Effect of SDF loss weight $\lambda$ on CAR and TSR. $\lambda = 0$: LoRA-only. $\lambda = 0.1$ (55.5\%) remains within the null band, confirming redundancy across a 20$\times$ loss weight range.}
\label{fig:lambda_car}
